# ycal-website (Vite + React)

- **Stack**: Vite 6, React 19, TypeScript, react-router-dom 7. Prefer patterns from [Vite](https://vite.dev/guide/) and [React](https://react.dev/) docs.
- **Routing**: Use react-router-dom consistently (layouts, loaders/actions if the project adopts them). Keep route components readable; extract shared UI into components under `src/` (or existing structure).
- **Build & quality**: Respect `tsc -b` and ESLint (`yarn lint` from repo root). Fix type and lint issues at the source; do not silence rules broadly.
- **Assets & env**: Use Vite conventions (`import.meta.env`, public assets). No Node-only APIs in client code.
- **Performance**: Lazy routes or code-splitting where it matches existing patterns; avoid premature optimization.
